{"product":{"id":8476525429075,"title":"SYSTEM 4 SCALP TONIC T","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSCALP TONIC T BY SYSTEM 4\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eTherapeutic tonic for oily scalp\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSuitable for daily use, Scalp Tonic dissolves crystallized oil, prevents scalp oiling and relieves itching. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Menthol refreshes and stimulates the superficial blood flow to the scalp. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003ePrevents scalp oiling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRemoves greasy dandruff and prevents it from forming again\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSoothes itchy scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eImproves scalp microcirculation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eParfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply directly to the scalp and rub the scalp lightly with your fingertips. Do not rinse. Can be used daily and also between washes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 3.5\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Scalp tonic","created_at":"2023-07-19T18:13:21+03:00","handle":"sim-sensitive-system-4-scalp-tonic-t","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:30+03:00","published_at":"2023-07-19T18:13:21+03:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"COSMETICS, SYSTEM4","variants":[{"id":46863459811667,"product_